                                  "fill": "#f2f1ec",
                                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
                                  "width": "fill_container",
                                  "height": 112.19,
                                  "content": "Runs fn inside a same-document view transition, so whatever it changes on screen cross-fades instead of snapping. Falls back to a plain call where the API is missing or the user asked for reduced motion. Concurrent calls are fine: the browser skips the one in flight.",
