                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "r4iXgn",
                          "name": "The box decides, not the display: a spli",
                          "context": "p",
                          "fill": "#f2f1ec",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "height": 84.14,
                          "content": "The box decides, not the display: a split half of the inner panel is as narrow as the cover, so an app that branches on useDisplay() gets a two-column layout in a space that cannot hold one. Attach the ref to whatever element the layout actually lives in.",
