                              "fill": "#f2f1ec",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "height": 112.19,
                              "content": "To build entirely in your browser, open Build, connect an OpenRouter key or a browser-accessible OpenAI-compatible endpoint, and describe your app. No local tools are needed. Your provider receives requests directly; Duo does not proxy your key or prompts.",
